{"id": "swebq0006", "pool": "swebq", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 3504602641, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "aa7a8a6f2040793a4fe8dabcb6d10f2520887b0e0988d37809c3a27ef31575d8", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 1, "query": "where to get a marriage license in long island?", "input_path": "/data/bench_audio/swebq0006.wav", "input_sha256": "0208d8cb59334feca8f4e118906df839c958574c74f4ae5cfe3ede2791f1ee24", "input_samples": 40106, "input_s": 2.507, "n_real_chunks": 3, "score": 0.7191, "act": 0.9983, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "In Long Island, NY, you get a marriage license from a Town Clerk or City Clerk—not generally from the county clerk. Both applicants typically must appear together.", "expert_answer": "In **Long Island, NY**, you get a marriage license from a **Town Clerk or City Clerk**—not generally from the county clerk. Under New York State rules, you may apply **in person at any town or city clerk in New York State**, and the license can be used anywhere in NY State. ([health.ny.gov](https://www.health.ny.gov/publications/4210/?utm_source=openai))\n\n**Common Long Island places to apply:**\n\n### Nassau County\nContact the clerk for the town/city where convenient:\n- **Town of Hempstead Clerk**\n- **Town of North Hempstead Clerk**\n- **Town of Oyster Bay Clerk**\n- **City of Long Beach Clerk**\n- **City of Glen Cove Clerk**\n\nNassau County notes that marriage records/licenses are tied to the **town or city clerk that issued the license**; the Nassau County Clerk generally does not issue current marriage licenses. ([nassaucountyny.gov](https://www.nassaucountyny.gov/479/Vital-Records?utm_source=openai))\n\n### Suffolk County\nApply through a **Town Clerk/Registrar**, such as:\n- **Babylon**\n- **Brookhaven**\n- **East Hampton**\n- **Huntington**\n- **Islip**\n- **Riverhead**\n- **Shelter Island**\n- **Smithtown**\n- **Southampton**\n- **Southold**\n\nSuffolk County states that birth, marriage, and death records are handled by the **Town Clerk and/or Registrar**, not the Suffolk County Clerk’s Office. ([suffolkcountyny.gov](https://suffolkcountyny.gov/Elected-Officials/County-Clerk/Birth-Marriage-and-Death-Certificates?utm_source=openai))\n\n**Before going:** call or check the specific clerk’s office for appointment requirements, hours, ID/document requirements, and fees. Both applicants typically must appear together.", "transcript": "Where to get a marriage license in Long Island.\n", "asr_s": 2.74, "expert_s": 10.43, "expert_input_samples": 40106, "expert_input_s": 2.507, "expert_input_sha256": "0208d8cb59334feca8f4e118906df839c958574c74f4ae5cfe3ede2791f1ee24", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 10.681, "relay_synth_ms": 4289, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 0, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0006_always_relay.wav", "sha256": "8e5b9baf189934651edbc2f889490dec6839ba6e74602378fe5217fe0a3d1f6b", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 10.68}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0006_always_candidate.wav", "sha256": "009949a1a53087b6b05cd3b66fafdafebb279e2d4ad076876fc053003081387a", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0006_always_stall.wav", "sha256": "cf508b269b9822c4f76f0a60851bd41c0ea630c58f3b7562261a1f1ab4ca3101", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.051, 1.095, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.052, 2.091, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 2.507, 2.56, 2.602, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.507, 3.559, 4.176, 0, 24000, 0]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 2.507, "last_real_feed_done": 2.56, "onset": 4.176, "gate_read_done": 4.176, "fire": 4.176, "candidate_first_pcm": 4.176, "stall_note": 4.177, "stall_first_pcm": 6.666, "local_first_pcm": null, "wait_start": 6.666, "expert_req": 4.177, "expert_resp": 17.346, "relay_synth_start": 17.348, "relay_first_pcm": 17.927, "relay_synth_end": 21.638, "first_any_pcm": 4.176, "first_answer_pcm": 17.927, "session_end": 21.752}, "ttfa_answer_s": 15.42, "ttfa_any_s": 1.669}
