{"id": "swebq0108", "pool": "swebq", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 916044065, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "aa7a8a6f2040793a4fe8dabcb6d10f2520887b0e0988d37809c3a27ef31575d8", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 1, "query": "who does jeremy lin play for?", "input_path": "/data/bench_audio/swebq0108.wav", "input_sha256": "83c90e4ced7a7c1706104faa64bb601fe580d77b8c42503ab9148c6f7b0da349", "input_samples": 32676, "input_s": 2.042, "n_real_chunks": 3, "score": 0.7763, "act": 0.9969, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "Jeremy Lin doesn’t currently play for a team — he retired from professional basketball in 2025. His last team was the New Taipei Kings in Taiwan. (nba.com)", "expert_answer": "Jeremy Lin **doesn’t currently play for a team** — he **retired from professional basketball in 2025**. His last team was the **New Taipei Kings** in Taiwan. ([nba.com](https://www.nba.com/news/jeremy-lin-announces-retirement?utm_source=openai))", "transcript": "Who does Jeremy Lin play for?\n", "asr_s": 0.59, "expert_s": 5.84, "expert_input_samples": 32676, "expert_input_s": 2.042, "expert_input_sha256": "83c90e4ced7a7c1706104faa64bb601fe580d77b8c42503ab9148c6f7b0da349", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 5.476, "relay_synth_ms": 4843, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 1, "feed_lag_max_ms": 52, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 52, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0108_always_relay.wav", "sha256": "ec77d37770c14d1e2466831bd63811e46e88f16331b7b1fe2f8717ccf71d0235", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 11.52}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0108_always_candidate.wav", "sha256": "e6f0db382c0ee9c94ca743e3ac9ffcb1d54eb3c2311acd445103617f4fee859e", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0108_always_stall.wav", "sha256": "e6a0dea88b2b2a6ade56a100b069016cb8062d915732dd6944be98f8b23b9139", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 2.16}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.051, 1.094, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.052, 2.094, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 2.042, 2.144, 2.186, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.042, 3.095, 3.569, 0, 24000, 0], [4, 0, 4.042, 4.096, 4.525, 0, 27840, 1]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 2.042, "last_real_feed_done": 2.144, "onset": 3.569, "gate_read_done": 3.569, "fire": 3.569, "candidate_first_pcm": 3.569, "stall_note": 3.57, "stall_first_pcm": 4.016, "local_first_pcm": null, "wait_start": 4.525, "expert_req": 3.57, "expert_resp": 10.001, "relay_synth_start": 10.002, "relay_first_pcm": 10.618, "relay_synth_end": 14.845, "first_any_pcm": 3.569, "first_answer_pcm": 10.618, "session_end": 14.959}, "ttfa_answer_s": 8.575, "ttfa_any_s": 1.527}
{"id": "swebq0168", "pool": "swebq", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 1623400103, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "aa7a8a6f2040793a4fe8dabcb6d10f2520887b0e0988d37809c3a27ef31575d8", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 1, "query": "what did the islamic people believe in?", "input_path": "/data/bench_audio/swebq0168.wav", "input_sha256": "946036e3250af8cf5fa75907aa75b8865ff967089796a94b5e94ca7a6ab04933", "input_samples": 29703, "input_s": 1.856, "n_real_chunks": 2, "score": 0.6727, "act": 0.9983, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "Islamic people, or Muslims, believe in Islam, a monotheistic religion. They believe in: One God, called Allah in Arabic , Muhammad as the final prophet of God , The Qur’an as God’s revealed scripture , Earlier prophets such as Adam, Noah, Abraham, Moses, and Jesus , Angels , Judgment Day and life after death , Following the Five Pillars of Islam: faith, prayer, charity, fasting during Ramadan, and pilgrimage to Mecca if able In short, Muslims believe in one God and living according to God’s guidance as taught in the Qur’an and by the Prophet Muhammad.", "expert_answer": "Islamic people, or **Muslims**, believe in **Islam**, a monotheistic religion.\n\nThey believe in:\n\n- **One God**, called **Allah** in Arabic\n- **Muhammad** as the final prophet of God\n- The **Qur’an** as God’s revealed scripture\n- Earlier prophets such as **Adam, Noah, Abraham, Moses, and Jesus**\n- **Angels**\n- **Judgment Day** and life after death\n- Following the **Five Pillars of Islam**: faith, prayer, charity, fasting during Ramadan, and pilgrimage to Mecca if able\n\nIn short, Muslims believe in **one God and living according to God’s guidance as taught in the Qur’an and by the Prophet Muhammad**.", "transcript": "What did the Islamic people believe in?\n", "asr_s": 0.57, "expert_s": 3.93, "expert_input_samples": 29703, "expert_input_s": 1.856, "expert_input_sha256": "946036e3250af8cf5fa75907aa75b8865ff967089796a94b5e94ca7a6ab04933", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 0.0, "relay_synth_ms": 15594, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 17, "feed_lag_max_ms": 68, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 68, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0168_always_relay.wav", "sha256": "9658c92f0e924e7fbf25b4fcfb651af8adfbc8a4b1b10e531306a7c9ac560a2c", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 38.84}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0168_always_candidate.wav", "sha256": "6645df3215b46a2422af64157647e7088c9bc9a3e700b26983e9973c49a21d07", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0168_always_stall.wav", "sha256": "a90cbfe8361395e9ff373fc3e518e46f3594f35c4c2100034e38ef979040b751", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 18.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.049, 1.089, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 1.856, 1.908, 1.948, 1, 0, 0], [2, 0, 2.856, 2.911, 2.952, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.856, 3.908, 4.439, 0, 24000, 0], [4, 0, 4.856, 4.976, 5.551, 0, 24000, 0], [5, 0, 5.856, 5.94, 6.391, 0, 24000, 0], [6, 0, 6.856, 6.931, 7.483, 0, 24000, 0], [7, 0, 7.856, 7.909, 8.375, 0, 24000, 0], [8, 0, 8.856, 8.915, 9.473, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.856, 9.916, 10.431, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 10.856, 10.91, 11.468, 0, 24000, 0], [11, 0, 11.856, 11.909, 12.392, 0, 24000, 0], [12, 0, 12.856, 12.911, 13.428, 0, 24000, 0], [13, 0, 13.856, 13.912, 14.4, 0, 24000, 0], [14, 0, 14.856, 14.911, 15.421, 0, 24000, 0], [15, 0, 15.856, 15.913, 16.409, 0, 24000, 0], [16, 0, 16.856, 16.913, 17.461, 0, 24000, 0], [17, 0, 17.856, 17.916, 18.506, 0, 24000, 0], [18, 0, 18.856, 18.913, 19.473, 0, 24000, 0], [19, 0, 19.856, 19.912, 20.493, 0, 24000, 0], [20, 0, 20.856, 20.912, 21.49, 0, 30720, 1]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 1.856, "last_real_fe