{"id": "swebq0240", "pool": "swebq", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 1583893070, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "aa7a8a6f2040793a4fe8dabcb6d10f2520887b0e0988d37809c3a27ef31575d8", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 1, "query": "where to go in vietnam beaches?", "input_path": "/data/bench_audio/swebq0240.wav", "input_sha256": "9d8d775be4cd69cf969cfc13e5446d6726386dc56d99d13dc3d7f671c177a1f7", "input_samples": 34162, "input_s": 2.135, "n_real_chunks": 3, "score": 0.6784, "act": 0.9925, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "Top beach places to go in Vietnam: Phú Quốc – Best overall beach island , Clear water, resorts, sunsets, snorkeling, island-hopping. , Best for couples, families, relaxing. (vietnam.travel) , Đà Nẵng / Mỹ Khê Beach – Best easy beach city , Long sandy beach, good hotels, nightlife, food, close to Hội An. , Best months: March–May and September–October. (vietnam.travel) , Nha Trang – Best for nightlife and activities , Beach city with bars, seafood, diving/snorkeling, boat trips.", "expert_answer": "Top beach places to go in **Vietnam**:\n\n1. **Phú Quốc** – Best overall beach island  \n   - Clear water, resorts, sunsets, snorkeling, island-hopping.  \n   - Best for couples, families, relaxing. ([vietnam.travel](https://www.vietnam.travel/vi/places-to-go/southern-vietnam/phu-quoc?utm_source=openai))\n\n2. **Đà Nẵng / Mỹ Khê Beach** – Best easy beach city  \n   - Long sandy beach, good hotels, nightlife, food, close to Hội An.  \n   - Best months: **March–May** and **September–October**. ([vietnam.travel](https://www.vietnam.travel/places-to-go/central-vietnam/da-nang?utm_source=openai))\n\n3. **Nha Trang** – Best for nightlife and activities  \n   - Beach city with bars, seafood, diving/snorkeling, boat trips. Vietnam Tourism notes Nha Trang has water sports and resort options. ([vietnam.travel](https://vietnam.travel/sites/default/files/2021-04/Coast_Islands_Vietnam.pdf?utm_source=openai))\n\n4. **Hội An / An Bàng Beach** – Best beach + culture  \n   - Stay near An Bàng or Cửa Đại beach and visit Hội An Ancient Town in the evening.\n\n5. **Côn Đảo** – Best quiet/luxury/nature beach  \n   - More remote, beautiful islands, less crowded, good for peaceful stays and diving. ([vietnamtourism.gov.vn](https://vietnamtourism.gov.vn/en/printer/19281?type=1&utm_source=openai))\n\n6. **Quy Nhơn** – Best underrated beach destination  \n   - Quieter than Đà Nẵng/Nha Trang, good seafood, scenic beaches like Kỳ Co and Eo Gió.\n\n**My quick recommendation:**  \n- First time in Vietnam: **Đà Nẵng + Hội An**  \n- Best tropical island: **Phú Quốc**  \n- Quiet and beautiful: **Côn Đảo or Quy Nhơn**  \n- Party/activity beach: **Nha Trang**", "transcript": "Where to go in Vietnam beaches.\n", "asr_s": 0.69, "expert_s": 9.01, "expert_input_samples": 34162, "expert_input_s": 2.135, "expert_input_sha256": "9d8d775be4cd69cf969cfc13e5446d6726386dc56d99d13dc3d7f671c177a1f7", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 9.041, "relay_synth_ms": 16647, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 0, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0240_always_relay.wav", "sha256": "2bf9994e818246469446b0f0d60a9238f5cf367088680a4b483966d9035bb230", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 38.28}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0240_always_candidate.wav", "sha256": "8f4b247a4c412c55165208ac3d5d76a7f4146db4730de9e413f8e216078a245f", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0240_always_stall.wav", "sha256": "2f6fd49d65609996b00ecfd4d5d99f9e24692bed53f0f177181edede62cb13fe", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.058, 1.105, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.058, 2.108, 1, 